; One variable: `layout_direction = 3` on the lower TabBar. Both bars are too narrow for four tabs
; with `clip_tabs = true`, so `buttons_visible` turns on and the scroll arrows draw. Under RTL the
; pair moves to the leading edge, the second arrow steps by the increment icon's width, and
; `missing_right` lights the decrement arrow (tab_bar.cpp:565-591).

